hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1189","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sharton mein sab se zyada haq wali shart jise tum poora karo wo hai jiskey sath tum ne sharmgaahon ko halaal kya. (Bukhari: 2721)"
"1190","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Dehaatiyon mein se aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun magar tum merey liye Allah ki Kitaab key sath faisla karo. To doosra fareeq jo us se zyada samajhdaar tha us ne kaha: Haan, hamaarey darmiyaan Allah ki Kitaab key sath faisla kijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho. Us ne kaha: Beshak mera beta iskey paas mazdoor tha aur us ne uski biwi se zina kya. Aur mujhey khabar di gai ke merey betey par rajm hai. To main ne us se sau bakriyaan aur londi dey kar fidya diya. To main ne ilm walon se poochha aur unhon-ne mujhey khabar di ke merey betey par sau kodey aur saal bhar jilawatni hai aur is aadmi ki biwi par rajm hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Main tumhaarey darmiyaan Allah ki Kitaab key sath faisla karunga. Londi aur bakriyaan wapas hain. Aur tumharey betey par sau kodey aur saal bhar jilawatni hai. Subah jao ae Unais iski biwi ki taraf, phir agar wo iqraar karey to use rajm karo. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo subah uskey paas gaya aur us ne iqraar kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo rajm ki gai. (Bukhari: 2725)"
"1191","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Khaibar walon ne Abdullah bin Umar key haath paon tod diye to Umar khateeb ho kar khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key Yahood se unkey maalon par muamla kya tha aur farmaya tha: Ham tumhey rehne dengey jab tak Allah tumhey rehne dey. Aur beshak Abdullah bin Umar apne maal ki taraf wahaan nikley aur raat ko un par hamla kya gaya aur unkey haath paon tod diye gaey. Aur hamaara wahaan unkey siwa koi dushman nahi hai. Wo hamaarey dushman aur muttaham hain. Aur main ne unhey nikaalney ki raey rakhi hai. Phir jab Umar ne uska pukhta iraada kya to unkey paas Bani Abil Huqaiq mein se aik aaya. To us ne kaha: Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen! Kya tum hamein nikaaltey ho jabke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein rehne diya tha aur hamaarey sath maalon par muamla kya tha aur hamaarey liye uski shart rakhi thi? To Umar ne kaha: Kya tum ne gumaan kya ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul bhool gaya hun: Tumhara kya haal hoga jab tum Khaibar se nikaaley jaaogey jabke tumhaari oontni tumhey raat ba raat daudaayegi? To us ne kaha: Ye Abul Qaasim ki mazaq thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha ae Allah key dushman! To Umar ne unhey nikaal diya aur unhey jo unka phal tha uski qeemat maal aur oont aur saamaan mein di: Kajawon aur rassiyon aur uskey siwa mein se. (Bukhari: 2730)"
"1192","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama aur Marwaan se riwayat hai, un mein se har aik apne saathi ki hadees ki tasdeeq karta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya key zamaaney mein nikley. Yahan tak ke jab wo raastey mein they to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Khaalid bin Waleed Ghameem mein Quraish key sawaaron mein muqaddamat-ul-jaish hai. To daaen taraf lo. To Allah ki qasam! Khaalid ko unki khabar na hui yahan tak ke wo lashkar key gubaar key paas they. To wo Quraish ko khabardaar karney key liye daudta hua gaya. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley yahan tak ke jab Aap us ghaati par they jahaan se un par utra jaata hai to Aapki oontni baith gai. To logon ne kaha: Hal hal! To wo zidd karney lagi. To unhon-ne kaha: Qaswa ziddi ho gai hai! Qaswa ziddi ho gai hai! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaswa ziddi nahi hui hai aur na wo uski aadat hai. Lekin use us ne rok diya hai jis ne haathi ko roka tha. Phir farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Wo mujh se koi tadbeer na maangengey jis mein wo Allah ki hurmaton ki taazeem kartey hon magar main unhey dey dunga. Phir Aap ne use haanka aur wo koodi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap un se hatey yahan tak ke Hudaibiya key aakhri hissey mein thodey paani waley gadhay par utrey jis se log thoda thoda letey they. To log Aap ko zyada der na theharney diye yahan tak ke use khaali kar diya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pyaas ki shikaayat ki gai. To Aap ne apne tarqash mein se teer nikaala, phir unhey hukm diya ke use us mein rakkhein. To Allah ki qasam! Wo unkey liye paani se ubalta raha yahan tak ke wo us se wapas huey. Phir jabke wo aise they ke Budail bin Warqa Khuzaai apni qaum Khuzaa mein se giroh key sath aaya. Aur wo Tihaama walon mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key raazdaan they. To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne Kaab bin Luayy aur Aamir bin Luayy ko chhoda hai jo Hudaibiya key paaniyon key kinaron par utrey hain jabke unkey sath doodh waley oont bachchon waley hain. Aur wo tum se ladengey aur tumhey Bait se rokengey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ham kisi se ladney key liye nahi aey hain. Lekin ham Umrah karney aey hain. Aur beshak Quraish ko ladai ne thaka diya hai aur unhey nuqsaan pahunchaaya hai. Phir agar wo chaahein to main un se muddat bhar sulah karunga aur wo merey aur logon key darmiyaan rukawat hata dein. Phir agar main ghaalib aaun to agar wo chaahein ke wo us mein daakhil hon jis mein log daakhil huey hain to karein. Warna unhon-ne aaraam paaya. Aur agar wo inkaar karein to qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Main un se apne is muamley par ladunga yahan tak ke meri gardan kat jaey aur Allah apna muamla poora karega. To Budail ne kaha: Main unhey jo tum kehtey ho pahunchaaunga. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo chala yahan tak ke Quraish key paas aaya. Us ne kaha: Beshak ham tumharey paas is aadmi key paas se aey hain aur ham ne use baat kehtey huey suna hai. Phir agar tum chaaaho ke ham use tum par pesh karein to karein. To unkey bewaqoofon ne kaha: Hamein haajat nahi hai ke tum hamein uskey baarey mein kuchh khabar do. Aur unkey raey walon ne kaha: Laao jo tum ne use kehtey huey suna hai. Us ne kaha: Main ne use aisa aisa kehtey huey suna hai. To us ne unhey wo sunaaya jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha. To Urwa bin Masood khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ae qaum! Kya tum baap ki tarah nahi ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: Kya main betey ki tarah nahi hun? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: Kya tum mujh par tohmat lagaatey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: Kya tum nahi jaantey ke main ne Ukaaz walon ko bulaaya. Phir jab unhon-ne mujh par susti ki to main tumharey paas apne ghar walon aur apney beton aur jo meri itaat karta tha usey ley kar aaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: Beshak ye tumhaarey saamney bhalai ki tadbeer pesh karta hai. Use qabool karo aur mujhey uskey paas jaaney do. Unhon-ne kaha: Uskey paas jao. To wo uskey paas aaya aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat karney laga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se Budail jaisi baat kahi. To Urwa ne us waqt kaha: Ae Muhammad! Batao agar tum ne apni qaum ka muamla jad se ukhaad diya to kya tum ne Arbon mein se kisi key baarey mein suna hai jis ne tum se pehley apne ghar walon ko tabaah kya ho? Aur agar doosri (soorat) ho to beshak main Allah ki qasam chehrey dekh raha hun. Aur beshak main logon mein se milay julay giroh dekh raha hun jo bhaagney aur tumhey chhorney key qaabil hain. To Abu Bakr Siddique ne us se kaha: Laat ki sharmgaah chooso! Kya ham us se bhaagengey aur use chhorengey? Us ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr. Us ne kaha: Khabardaar! Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tumhaara mujh par ehsaan na hota jiska main ne tumhey badla na diya hota to main tumhey jawaab deta. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat karta raha. Phir jab bhi wo baat karta to Aapki daadhi pakadta jabke Mugheera bin Shoaba Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sar par khadey they jabke unkey paas talwaar thi aur un par khud tha. Phir jab bhi Urwa apna haath Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daadhi ki taraf jhukaata to wo uska haath talwaar key jootey se maartey. Aur us se kehtey: Apna haath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daadhi se peechey karo. To Urwa ne apna sar uthaaya aur kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Mugheera bin Shoaba. To us ne kaha: Ae dhokebaaz! Kya main teri dhokebaazi mein koshish nahi kar raha hun? Aur Mugheera jaahiliyat mein qaum key sath raha tha aur unhey qatl kya tha aur unkey maal liye they. Phir aaya aur Musalman ho gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ko to qabool karta hun. Aur maal ka to main us mein kuchh nahi hun. Phir Urwa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ko apni aankhon se dekhney laga. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne thook ya balgham na phenka magar wo un mein se kisi aadmi ki hatheli mein pada aur us ne us se apna chehra aur apni jild mali. Aur jab Aap unhey hukm detey to wo Aap key hukm ki taraf daudtey. Aur jab Aap wuzu kartey to wo qareeb hotey ke uskey wuzu par ladtey. Aur jab wo baat kartey to Aap key paas apni aawaazein neechi rakhtey. Aur Aapki taraf taazeem ki wajah se nigaah na uthaatey. To Urwa apne sahaaba ki taraf wapas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae qaum! Allah ki qasam! Main baadshahon key paas wafd ban kar gaya hun. Aur Qaisar aur Kisra aur Najaashi key paas wafd ban kar gaya hun. Allah ki qasam! Main ne kabhi baadshah nahi dekha jiski uskey sahaaba taazeem kartey hon jaisi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba Muhammad ki taazeem kartey hain. Allah ki qasam! Wo thook ya balgham nahi phenktey magar wo un mein se kisi aadmi ki hatheli mein padta hai aur wo us se apna chehra aur apni jild malta hai. Aur jab wo unhey hukm detey hain to wo uskey hukm ki taraf daudtey hain. Aur jab wo wuzu kartey hain to wo qareeb hotey hain ke uskey wuzu par ladtey hain. Aur jab wo baat kartey hain to Aap key paas apni aawaazein neechi rakhtey hain. Aur Aapki taraf taazeem ki wajah se nigaah nahi uthaatey. Aur beshak us ne tumhaarey saamney bhalai ki tadbeer pesh ki hai. To use qabool karo. To Bani Kinaana mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Mujhey uskey paas jaaney do. To unhon-ne kaha: Uskey paas jao. Phir jab wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba par zaahir hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye fulaan hai aur wo qaum mein se hai jo qurbaani key oonton ki taazeem karti hai. To use uskey liye bhejo. To use uskey liye bhejey gaey aur log uska talbiya kehtey huey isteqbaal karney lagey. Phir jab us ne wo dekha to us ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Inhey Bait se rokna munaasib nahi hai. Phir jab wo apne sahaaba ki taraf wapas aaya to us ne kaha: Main ne qurbaani key oont dekhey hain jinhey haar pehnaaya gaya hai aur nishaan lagaaya gaya hai. To meri raey mein unhey Bait se rokna nahi hai. To un mein se aik aadmi khada hua jisey Mikraz bin Hafs kaha jaata hai. To us ne kaha: Mujhey uskey paas jaaney do. To unhon-ne kaha: Uskey paas jao. Phir jab wo un par zaahir hua to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye Mikraz hai aur wo faasiq aadmi hai. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat karney laga. Phir jabke wo Aap se baat kar raha tha ke Suhail bin Amr aaya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhaara muamla tumharey liye aasaan kar diya gaya hai. Suhail bin Amr ne kaha: Laao, hamaarey aur tumharey darmiyaan kitaab likho. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaatib ko bulaaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai. Suhail ne kaha: Rahman ka to Allah ki qasam main nahi jaanta ke wo kya hai? Lekin likho: Ae Allah terey naam key sath, jaisa tum likhtey they. To Musalmaanon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham use Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai key siwa na likhengey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Likho: Ae Allah terey naam key sath. Phir farmaya: Ye wo hai jis par Muhammad Rasulullah ne sulah ki. To Suhail ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar ham jaantey ke tum Rasulullah ho to ham tumhey Bait se na roktey aur na tum se ladtey. Lekin likho: Muhammad bin Abdullah. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main Rasulullah hun agarchey tum ne mujhey jhutlaaya hai. Likho: Muhammad bin Abdullah. Raawi ne kaha: Aur wo uskey qaul (wo mujh se koi tadbeer na maangengey jis mein wo Allah ki hurmaton ki taazeem kartey hon magar main unhey dey dunga) ki wajah se tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Is par ke tum hamaarey aur Bait key darmiyaan rukawat hata dogey aur ham uska tawaaf karengey. To Suhail ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Arab baat na karengey ke ham dabao mein aa gaey. Lekin wo aaney waley saal se hoga. To likha. To Suhail ne kaha: Aur is par ke ham mein se koi aadmi tumharey paas na aaeyga agarchey wo tumharey deen par ho magar tum use hamari taraf wapas karogey. Musalmaanon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Mushrikeen ki taraf kaisey wapas kya jaaeyga jabke wo Musalman aaya hai? Phir jabke wo aise they ke Abu Jandal bin Suhail bin Amr daakhil hua jabke wo apni bediyon mein ghisat raha tha. Aur wo Makkah key neechey se nikla tha yahan tak ke us ne apne aap ko Musalmaanon key darmiyaan daal diya. To Suhail ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Ye pehla hai jis par main tum se sulah karta hun ke tum use meri taraf wapas karo. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ham ne kitaab poori nahi ki hai. Us ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Phir main tum se kabhi kisi cheez par sulah na karunga. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To use merey liye bakhsh do. Us ne kaha: Main tumhey bakhshney wala nahi hun. Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, karo. Us ne kaha: Main karney wala nahi hun. Mikraz ne kaha: Balke ham ne use tumharey liye bakhsh diya hai. Abu Jandal ne kaha: Ae Musalmaanon ki jamaat! Kya main mushrikeen ki taraf wapas kya jaaunga jabke main Musalman aaya hun! Kya tum nahi dekhtey jo main ne jhela hai? Aur use Allah key liye sakht azaab diya gaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: To main Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To main ne kaha: Kya tum waqai Allah key Nabi nahi ho? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Main ne kaha: Kya ham haq par nahi hain aur hamaara dushman baatil par nahi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Main ne kaha: Phir ham apne deen mein zillat kyun dein? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main Allah ka Rasool hun aur main uski naafarmaani nahi karta. Aur wo mera madadgaar hai. Main ne kaha: Kya tum hamein khabar na detey they ke ham Bait mein aaeengey aur uska tawaaf karengey? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. To kya main ne tumhey khabar di thi ke ham us mein is saal aaeengey? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tum us mein aaogey aur uska tawaaf karogey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Abu Bakr key paas aaya. To main ne kaha: Ae Abu Bakr! Kya ye waqai Allah key Nabi nahi hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Main ne kaha: Kya ham haq par nahi hain aur hamaara dushman baatil par nahi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Main ne kaha: Phir ham apne deen mein zillat kyun dein? Unhon-ne kaha: Ae aadmi! Beshak wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. Aur wo apne Rab ki naafarmaani nahi kartey. Aur wo unka madadgaar hai. To uski rakaab pakdey raho. Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo haq par hain. Main ne kaha: Kya wo hamein khabar na detey they ke ham Bait mein aaeengey aur uska tawaaf karengey? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Kya us ne tumhey khabar di ke tum us mein is saal aaogey? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak tum us mein aaogey aur uska tawaaf karogey. Umar ne kaha: To main ne uskey liye aamaal kiye. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab wo kitaab key faisley se faarigh hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba se farmaya: Utho aur qurbaani karo, phir mundwaao. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Un mein se koi aadmi na utha yahan tak ke Aap ne wo teen martaba farmaya. Phir jab un mein se koi na utha to Aap Umm Salma key paas daakhil huey aur un se wo zikr kya jo Aap ne logon se paaya tha. To Umm Salma ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Kya tum wo pasand kartey ho? Niklo, phir un mein se kisi se baat na karo yahan tak ke apni qurbaani nahr karo aur apne naai ko bulaao aur wo tumhey mundwaaey. To Aap nikley aur un mein se kisi se baat na ki yahan tak ke Aap ne wo kya. Apni qurbaani nahr ki aur apne naai ko bulaaya aur us ne Aap ko mundwaaya. Phir jab unhon-ne wo dekha to wo uthay aur unhon-ne qurbaani ki. Aur un mein se baaz baaz ko mundwaanay lagey yahan tak ke qareeb tha ke un mein se baaz gham se baaz ko qatl kar dein. Phir Aap key paas momin auratein aaein. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Ae imaan walon! Jab tumharey paas momin auratein hijrat kar key aaein to unhey aazmaao) yahan tak ke (kaafir auraton key nikahon key sath) tak. To Umar ne us din do biwiyon ko talaaq di jo shirk mein unki thein. To un mein se aik se Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ne nikaah kya aur doosri se Safwaan bin Umayya ne. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina wapas aey. To Aap key paas Abu Baseer aaya jo Quraish mein se aadmi tha jabke wo Musalman tha. To unhon-ne uski talaash mein do aadmi bhejey aur unhon-ne kaha: Wo ahd jo tum ne hamaarey liye kya tha. To Aap ne use donon aadmiyon key supurd kar diya. To wo donon usey ley kar nikley yahan tak ke Zul Hulaifa tak pahunchey. To wo utrey aur unki khajooron mein se khaatey they. To Abu Baseer ne donon aadmiyon mein se aik se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tumhaari ye talwaar ae fulaan achhi dekh raha hun. To doosrey ne use myaan se nikaala. To us ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo achhi hai. Main ne use aazmaaya hai phir aazmaaya hai. To Abu Baseer ne kaha: Mujhey dikhaao, main use dekhun. To us ne use usey dey diya aur us ne use maara yahan tak ke wo thanda ho gaya. Aur doosra bhaaga yahan tak ke Madina aaya aur masjid mein daudta hua daakhil hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab use dekha to farmaya: Beshak ye khauf dekha hua hai. Phir jab wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pahuncha to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam mera saathi qatl kya gaya aur beshak main qatl kya jaaunga. To Abu Baseer aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Allah ki qasam Allah ne tumhaara zimma poora kar diya hai. Tum ne mujhey unki taraf wapas kar diya tha, phir Allah ne mujhey un se najaat di. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski maan par afsos! Ladai bhadkaane wala hai, kaash uskey paas koi hota! Phir jab us ne wo suna to us ne jaan liya ke wo use unki taraf wapas karengey. To wo nikla yahan tak ke samandar key kinaarey aaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur un se Abu Jandal bin Suhail nikal bhaaga. To wo Abu Baseer se jaa mila. To Quraish mein se jo Musalman aadmi nikalta wo Abu Baseer se jaa milta yahan tak ke un mein se giroh jama ho gaya. To Allah ki qasam! Wo Quraish key oont nahi suntey they jo Shaam ki taraf nikley hon magar wo unkey saamney aatey aur unhey qatl kartey aur unkey maal letey. To Quraish ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bheja jabke wo Allah aur rishtedaari ka waasta detey they ke Aap bhejein. Phir jo Aap key paas aaya wo aman mein hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf bheja. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Aur wahi hai jis ne unkey haath tum se aur tumharey haath un se Makkah key pet mein rok diye, uskey baad ke us ne tumhey un par ghalba diya) yahan tak ke (jaahiliyat ki ghairat) tak. Aur unki ghairat ye thi ke unhon-ne iqraar na kya ke wo Allah key Nabi hain. Aur unhon-ne Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai ka iqraar na kya. Aur unkey aur Bait key darmiyaan haael huey. (Bukhari: 2731-2732)"
"1193","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah key ninaanbe naam hain, sau mein aik kam. Jo unhey yaad karey wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. (Bukhari: 2736). Wasiyaton ki kitaab."
